# The room's image (Dockerfile, T-09) is built from the repository root, so this
# is an allowlist: everything is excluded, then exactly what the build reads is
# let back in. Without it, room/target/ (gigabytes), .git/, the pipeline, the
# prototypes and every other question in the bank would go to Fly's builder.
#
# The rest of bank/questions/ stays out on purpose: the image seeds q3 alone, and
# a question that is not in the build context cannot end up in the image.

*
!room/Cargo.toml
!room/Cargo.lock
!room/src
!web
web/test
!bank/questions/q3.json
